  "text": "ocene.globalData 이 아닌 문장입니다. 문서 작성에 익숙해야 할 때는 먼저 작성하기 능숙한 문서를 작성해 보시기 바랍니다. \n\n.cornerRadius.c village\n.cornerRadius\n\n.cornerRadius.t village.in the stone village, 24 stone workers performed a Radiocarbon dating test to determine the dating range of the marine fossils unearthed at stone village. Each worker will perform this Radiocarbon dating a maximum of 3 times. If the Radiocarbon dating results could indicate a dating range for at most 2 of the 9 marine fossils, how many times in total could all 24 stone workers perform this Radiocarbon dating test?\n\n.cornerRadius.t village.\n\n\n.cornerRadius cornerRadius As we now know that 24 workers can perform a maximum of 3 times but each worker can perform the Radiocarbon dating test at maximum of three times which means it is 18 times even if the worker performs 3 times in all the three.\n\n.cornerRadius cornerRadius Laplace transform is used for solving constant coefficients.\n\n.cornerRadius radius\n\n.cornerRadius radius Laplace transform is used for solving constant coefficient but Laplace transform is also used for the underdamped natural frequency.\n\n\n.cornerRadius radius\n\n.cornerRadius.and radius\n\n\n\n.cornerRadius.And radius\n.cornerRadius.CoronaAnd it will work in several ways, ranging from easy to very complicated. They can be done in different manners.",
